{{- /*
model.compat — the leg package's version-skew witness.

A generated file drives every model row through legs.Law or
legs.Differential, and a breaking change to either would compile against a
file generated before it and run the wrong idiom without saying so. The
harness's own witness covers the check vocabulary; this covers the legs.
*/ -}}
{{- define "model.compat" -}}
// A second version check, for the leg idioms the rows above ride. The
// harness's own covers the check format; this one covers what a model row
// does with it. Regenerate the file to clear a mismatch.
var _ = {{ renderExpr (external .LegsPkg "CompatV1") }}
{{- end -}}
